ps://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391887_666132786196203_3306836798191494038_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZW8sQTVdi8oQ7kNvwEn_w-_&_nc_oc=AdqLSC5J2UVNOSBi3jPCg-opQz5b132JqaTKzBuQir_4yxADeKhvnj2apm0tnw5r56E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7VZD2Tk8UmYPODej1YDwwpGPBQ8kYWYHcTsvJGUPswjg&oe=6A0F00C6"}, {"file_name": "ss4.png", "id": "1060019686034544", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393333_1060019689367877_3649349240982617019_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4R82VBKdCX8Q7kNvwEXxiDI&_nc_oc=AdrLKUyNo0lIfxgbbJFEz9hOwdX_fBWtD97hqjiNv_pfOCruUmcsosQPrjTq734t9Fc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7IIDOegrTR74B_UxcRVYh3Hu60awKjDuL-uLRftWyUCw&oe=6A0F0F45"}, {"file_name": "ss6.png", "id": "1401863104460099", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394280_1401863107793432_7555648286168544609_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=spfbjH7kP9AQ7kNvwHZ48yc&_nc_oc=AdropKXEENQCDnsSNdKxfqjHTvR3I2FZUB8KRgwi04tAV-t5HxfyCdl3F6FGS_9pYW8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af46qZf3ldQC1PCmdXdM2PEsfwv5KlTjQ5ej8HFPlFOkTQ&oe=6A0EFA0F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Landscape.png", "id": "1186592132768057", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393673_1186592139434723_4312517559630060959_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2jfx_zRKPx4Q7kNvwEF3arA&_nc_oc=AdrOqWik8t8OhXliQozY1F4Et8KFnig1wK-heFyru4dsY6d_BfGeEvQWdH4ESn0Iq5Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6GCr13lO_nRQAgOMkRy0X2v9QldOmL79sqVArHSu21cA&oe=6A0EFB8E"}, "display_name": "Stunt X Mania (SXM)", "keywords": ["Stunt", "Race", "Sports", "MotoX", "Racing"], "long_description": "# Push the limits, defy gravity, and perform insane stunts!\n\n\ud83c\udfae **Game Overview**: \nStunt X Mania isn't just a game, it's an experience. Have you ever wondered if you could go crazy and perform insane motocross and stunts at home? We bring to you hyper-realistic bike controls like you've never experienced before! Hone your riding skills and go on a frenzy of stunts, wheelies, endos, 360 flips, and more. Our early access will help you get ready for our exciting next updates\n\n\ud83c\udfc1 **Key Features**\n- Perform 360 flips, Superman, Cliffhanger, Lazy-boy, and Heel-clicker and more stunts!\n- Enjoy a new hyper-realistic vehicle control system, with engaging clutch and gear mechanics, wheelies, endos, whips, and crazy jumps!\n\n\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f **Game Modes**\n\n- **Free Roam** -  No-holds barred, perform tricks without thinking of running out of time across 8 CRAZY ARENAS!\n\n- **Career Mode** - Perform stunts to earn points and finish the lap before time ends and ride to glory among leaderboards! (COMING SOON)\n\n- **Co-op** - Ride with friends and family, display your skills and become a pro! (COMING SOON)\n\n- **Multiplayer** - Be the Master, champion lobbies, and boast your skills! (COMING SOON)\n\n\ud83c\udfa7 **Immersive Soundtrack**\n\n- **High-energy electronic beats** to enhance your ride. Featuring tracks from our own indie-crew.\n\nThis is not the end! We will bring enhancing updates across the game, more stunts, new arenas, a brand new store, DLCs and more. **Stunt X Mania is the place to be, you can't miss it!**", "short_description": "Stunt X Mania (SXM) is an adrenaline-pumping motocross and stunts game where players perform freestyle tricks, defy physics, and hone their motocross skills across electrifying open arenas. With hyper realistic bike control and high-speed circuits, and crazy stunts, Stunt X Mania is for thrill-seekers. Enjoy 8 arenas, hyper-realistic bike controls, wheelies, endos, 360 flips. You want more? Execute Superman, Lazy Boy, Cliffhangers, Heel Click stunts right now! Career Mode and MORE COMING SOON!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "